OL,3,GNEWSAGirls 'ill' after training for
OL,4,ABristol Channel swim
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo 14-year-old girls who swam the
OL,7,FBristol Channel to raise awareness of
OL,8,Fsewage pollution as part of a world
OL,9,Frecord attempt say they became unwell
OL,10,Fafter training in the sea.
OL,12,FBest friends Izzy Shewry and Susy
OL,13,FHavenhand-Iago swam nearly 20 miles
OL,14,F(32km) from Penarth in Wales to
OL,15,FClevedon, North Somerset, in under six
OL,16,Fhours and 30 minutes on Wednesday.
OL,18,FTheir coach Hamish McCarthy said he was
OL,19,Fconfident the pair had broken the
OL,20,Frecord for the youngest people to swim
OL,21,Fthe c and they would have confirmation
OL,22,Fin September.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
