OL,5,
OL,6,FBut while training for the swim, which
OL,7,Fthey did to raise awareness about
OL,8,Fsewage pollution, one fell ill after
OL,9,Fswimming in the sea in Devon and the
OL,10,Fother from the Bristol Channel.
